FF Milo Serif
-------------

The compact travel edition is specified to compose against licensed
FF Milo Serif Text desktop fonts (FontFont / MyFonts; designer Mike Abbink).
Those files are not bundled. Place a desktop-licensed copy in fonts/milo/
on one workstation. See fonts/milo/README.md. The loved-face print target
will not download or silently substitute another face.

Source Serif 4 (grid proof only)
--------------------------------

`fonts/grid-proof/` vendors Source Serif 4 for a watermarked metrics
compile (`GRID PROOF — NOT FINAL FACE`). Source Serif is a trademark of
Adobe. The font software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1. See `fonts/grid-proof/OFL.txt`. This stand-in is never the
loved face.

route.bible links
-----------------

Generated PDFs may include links to https://route.bible/ for Scripture
navigation. route.bible is an external service and is not bundled with this
toolkit.
